<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed all five credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.301  bln pesos 15 days  32.03  31.90   31.97    5    4</p>
<p>1.301  bln pesos 14 days  32.04  32.00   32.04    2    2</p>
<p>1.302  bln pesos  8 days  31.88  31.72   31.79    8    2</p>
<p>1.302  bln pesos  3 days  31.70  31.68   31.11    4    3</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  1 day   31.06  30.90   31.08    2    2</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
